{"id":"3e8e1e5e44d83748","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-cor-ground-ax-uniqueness.md","title":"Ground Axiom Uniqueness","display":"cor-ground-ax-uniqueness — Ground Axiom Uniqueness","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-ground-ax-uniqueness","aliases":["58-cor-ground-ax-uniqueness"],"display":"cor-ground-ax-uniqueness — Ground Axiom Uniqueness","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-ground.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-ground-axiom.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-class.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-ground-ax-uniqueness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-ground-ax-uniqueness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-ground-ax-uniqueness — Ground Axiom Uniqueness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d0244462250ae67e\" href=\"?note=d0244462250ae67e\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ground.md\">../batch06/58-df-ground.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"031def7d5c89ab92\" href=\"?note=031def7d5c89ab92\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ground-axiom.md\">../batch05/58-df-ground-axiom.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-class.md\">../batch11/58-df-class.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V,W\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\">\\(V,W\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\\)</span> (类模型参数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-class.md\">../batch11/58-df-class.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Class}_S:\\mathsf{Cls}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Class}_S:\\mathsf{Cls}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (类谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-class.md\">../batch11/58-df-class.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GroundAxiom}_S:\\mathsf{Cls}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{GroundAxiom}_S:\\mathsf{Cls}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (Ground Axiom 谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"031def7d5c89ab92\" href=\"?note=031def7d5c89ab92\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ground-axiom.md\">../batch05/58-df-ground-axiom.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S:\\mathsf{Cls}^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S:\\mathsf{Cls}^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (ground 模型谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d0244462250ae67e\" href=\"?note=d0244462250ae67e\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ground.md\">../batch06/58-df-ground.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}ground\\text{-}ax\\text{-}uniqueness} \\vdash \\mathrm{GroundAxiom}_S(V)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Class}_S(V)\\land\\forall W\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Class}_S(W)\\land W\\subseteq V\\land\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,V)\\to W=V\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}ground\\text{-}ax\\text{-}uniqueness} \\vdash \\mathrm{GroundAxiom}_S(V)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Class}_S(V)\\land\\forall W\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Class}_S(W)\\land W\\subseteq V\\land\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,V)\\to W=V\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ground axiom says the current universe is not a forcing extension of any proper ground.</li>\n<li>It implies uniqueness of the ground model.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothes